ched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}